    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Synopsis</strong>  <br><strong>Forbidden Research.</strong>  <br>A study forever banned in Eden, never to be touched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when someone dares to resurrect it,  <br>Officer Nazel begins his pursuit of the culprit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one behind it all is none other than his half-brother, Hazard.  <br>Leaving his confusion behind, Nazel sets off to chase his brother.  <br>However, he soon finds himself entangled in an irreversible fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>About the Game</strong>  <br>CODE: Antithesis is a single-player game combining story-driven action-adventure gameplay with visual novel elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1) Immersive Storyline</strong>  <br>Uncover the hidden truths of a world bound by forbidden research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2) NPC Interaction</strong>  <br>Listen not only to the case but also to the heartfelt stories of your colleagues.  <br>Before you know it, you'll come to understand their choices and beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3) Puzzles and Combat</strong>  <br>Gather clues, solve puzzles, and subdue the culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4) Adventure</strong>  <br>Investigate crime scenes and explore various locations in Eden.  <br>Help your colleagues and navigate the institution easily through the map.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Synopsis</strong>  <br><strong>Forbidden Research.</strong>  <br>A study forever banned in Eden, never to be touched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when someone dares to resurrect it,  <br>Officer Nazel begins his pursuit of the culprit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one behind it all is none other than his half-brother, Hazard.  <br>Leaving his confusion behind, Nazel sets off to chase his brother.  <br>However, he soon finds himself entangled in an irreversible fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>About the Game</strong>  <br>CODE: Antithesis is a single-player game combining story-driven action-adventure gameplay with visual novel elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1) Immersive Storyline</strong>  <br>Uncover the hidden truths of a world bound by forbidden research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2) NPC Interaction</strong>  <br>Listen not only to the case but also to the heartfelt stories of your colleagues.  <br>Before you know it, you'll come to understand their choices and beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3) Puzzles and Combat</strong>  <br>Gather clues, solve puzzles, and subdue the culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4) Adventure</strong>  <br>Investigate crime scenes and explore various locations in Eden.  <br>Help your colleagues and navigate the institution easily through the map.</p>",
    "short_description": "An irreversible choice between brothers, endless pursuit, and hidden truths. What awaits at the end...?",
